{"id": "UgwY2S4lIwaiEpez_Rt4AaABAg.AafcFBVC6pxAajn4jsbEwr", "parent": "UgwY2S4lIwaiEpez_Rt4AaABAg", "likes": 1, "text": "​@새해복많이받으세요대\n네  맞는 말이세요\n그저 안타까울  뿐입니다", "published": "2026-09-14T13:51:23", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
